@title Top bar: Help button, What's new as an icon, workspace tooltip
@area Layout
# Follow-up of lane V2a (docs/design/visual-redesign.md section 3.1). With the menu
# words hidden the bar has a Help icon that opens the app menu at Help, and
# What's new is a sparkle with its count. The pointer rests on the second
# workspace button: at 1366 it is an icon whose name is the tooltip; at 1920
# the names are shown and the pointer is just over the segment.
fresh
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text preferences
wait 8
key Enter
wait 10
click_text Hidden
wait 6
key Escape
wait 8
click_text "Open example"
wait 40
shot bar-help-whats-new
expect "Help"
check_layout
move 691 19
wait 30
shot workspace-tooltip
click_text "Help"
wait 10
expect "About"
expect "Lesson"
shot help-area
check_layout
